mini_bs_roformer.bin holds the weights of Mini-BS-RoFormer-18M by HiDolen,
converted by tools/convert_mini_bs_roformer.py. The model and its weights
are published at https://huggingface.co/HiDolen/Mini-BS-RoFormer-18M,
whose model card gives their licence as MIT. Its code is adapted from
https://github.com/lucidrains/BS-RoFormer (MIT).

The weights were trained on MUSDB18-HQ, a dataset published for research.
Whether its terms reach models trained on it is unsettled; this copy is
for our own, non-commercial use.

